Version 4
SHEET 1 3200 1800
TEXT -400 -400 Left 2 ;System D: three-way skeleton after Figure 1 of the project guide. Everything reads ../data (export_systemD.m). It runs as it is: biquad slots = gain 1, passive slots = plain wires.
TEXT -400 -368 Left 2 ;Digital: paste DigitalCrossover.m's LaplaceTXT_E1/E2 into the Value of E_LP1/E_LP2 (woofer) and E_HP1/E_HP2 (mid/tweeter). For n = 2 leave the second slot at 1.
TEXT -400 -336 Left 2 ;Passive: replace the wire inside each dashed box with the filter. Values only from Appendix 1. Sum: V(Psum) on axis, V(Psum30) at 30 deg; gains g_ and polarities p_ below.
SYMBOL voltage -400 -16 R0
WINDOW 0 -56 40 Right 2
WINDOW 3 -56 72 Right 2
SYMATTR InstName V1
SYMATTR Value 0
SYMATTR Value2 AC 1
FLAG -400 0 Vin
FLAG -400 80 0
TEXT -80 -96 Left 2 ;woofer: digital LPF (MiniDSP output 1)
SYMBOL e 0 -16 R0
WINDOW 0 24 104 Left 2
WINDOW 3 24 136 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName E_LP1
SYMATTR Value 1
FLAG 0 80 0
WIRE -48 16 -96 16
FLAG -96 16 Vin
WIRE -48 64 -96 64
FLAG -96 64 0
WIRE 0 0 112 0
FLAG 112 0 lp1
SYMBOL e 256 -16 R0
WINDOW 0 24 104 Left 2
WINDOW 3 24 136 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName E_LP2
SYMATTR Value 1
FLAG 256 80 0
WIRE 208 16 160 16
FLAG 160 16 lp1
WIRE 208 64 160 64
FLAG 160 64 0
WIRE 256 0 400 0
FLAG 400 0 Vspkr_woof
TEXT -80 224 Left 2 ;mid + tweeter: digital HPF (MiniDSP output 2)
SYMBOL e 0 304 R0
WINDOW 0 24 104 Left 2
WINDOW 3 24 136 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName E_HP1
SYMATTR Value 1
FLAG 0 400 0
WIRE -48 336 -96 336
FLAG -96 336 Vin
WIRE -48 384 -96 384
FLAG -96 384 0
WIRE 0 320 112 320
FLAG 112 320 hp1
SYMBOL e 256 304 R0
WINDOW 0 24 104 Left 2
WINDOW 3 24 136 Left 2
SYMATTR InstName E_HP2
SYMATTR Value 1
FLAG 256 400 0
WIRE 208 336 160 336
FLAG 160 336 hp1
WIRE 208 384 160 384
FLAG 160 384 0
WIRE 256 320 400 320
FLAG 400 320 Vhp
TEXT 560 -16 Left 2 ;woofer TF: V(Pout_woof)
FLAG 0 640 Vhp
WIRE 0 640 448 640
RECTANGLE Normal 64 528 400 784 2
